sequenceDiagram
  participant CRON as Nightly poller
  participant API as API service
  participant YT as YouTube Analytics
  participant DB as Database
  participant REC as Recommender
  actor C as Creator

  CRON->>API: run daily ingest
  loop each published video
    API->>YT: views, CTR, duration, retention
    YT-->>API: metrics
    API->>DB: store MetricSnapshot
  end
  API->>REC: recompute channel baseline
  REC->>DB: read snapshots + scene breakdowns
  REC->>REC: locate retention drop-off per scene
  REC->>REC: correlate hooks and titles with CTR
  REC->>DB: write recommendations
  C->>API: open dashboard
  API-->>C: performance vs baseline + next topics
  Note over REC,C: learned preferences feed the next script
